  "usage": "eight-digit number: 12 34-56-78 in Ashgabat, (322) 5-12-34 or +993 422 6 12 34 elsewhere; or only the code: 322. Inside the country a long-distance number starts with the trunk 8 (8 322 …): drop that 8",
  "note": "Eight-digit national numbers. Ashgabat has the two-digit code 12, other places three- or four-digit codes, in the alphabetical order of the provinces: 1xx Ahal, 2xx Balkan, 3xx Daşoguz, 4xx Lebap, 5xx Mary. Arkadag numbers are 12 57 xx xx.",
